      <data key="d3">chunk-c35816f05289661283f683145d9f395f</data>
      <data key="d2">Immunotherapy includes Nivolumab, an immune checkpoint inhibitor used to treat metastatic anal cancer by enhancing the immune system's ability to attack cancer cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Immunotherapy includes drugs like Nivolumab, which are immune checkpoint inhibitors for metastatic anal cancer.</data>
