      <data key="d3">chunk-c35816f05289661283f683145d9f395f</data>
      <data key="d2">Oxaliplatin, a platinum-based chemotherapy drug, can cause nerve damage in fingers and toes.&lt;SEP&gt;Oxaliplatin, a platinum-based chemotherapy drug, can cause peripheral neuropathy, leading to numbness, tingling, and pain in fingers and toes.</data>
      <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
    </node>
