      <data key="d5">The NCCN Guidelines for Patients provide treatment recommendations and care strategies for basal cell skin cancer, including management of recurrence and risk factors.&lt;SEP&gt;The NCCN Guidelines for Patients provides detailed information and treatment protocols for managing Basal Cell Skin Cancer.</data>
