      <data key="d4">27.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Prostate Cancer is influenced by Risk Factors such as age, family history, and lifestyle, which increase the likelihood of developing the disease.&lt;SEP&gt;Prostate Cancer is influenced by various Risk Factors such as age, family history, and genetic mutations, which increase an individual's likelihood of developing the disease.</data>
