    <edge source="Imaging" target="Recurrence">
      <data key="d4">20.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Imaging is critical for identifying and assessing the extent of cancer recurrence after initial treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Imaging is essential for identifying and assessing the extent of cancer recurrence after initial treatment.</data>
