      <data key="d4">36.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Adenocarcinoma develops from adenomas, representing a malignant transformation of benign polyps.&lt;SEP&gt;Adenoma can progress to adenocarcinoma, a malignant form of colon cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Adenoma is a type of polyp that can develop into adenocarcinoma, the most common type of colon cancer.</data>
