    <edge source="FDG-PET/CT" target="Cancer">
      <data key="d4">27.0</data>
      <data key="d5">FDG-PET/CT provides detailed metabolic and anatomical data to stage cancer, locate metastases, and assess treatment response.&lt;SEP&gt;FDG-PET/CT scans are used to identify cancer in lymph nodes and distant sites, aiding in staging and treatment planning.</data>
      <data key="d6">cancer staging, multimodal imaging&lt;SEP&gt;diagnostic imaging, cancer staging</data>
