      <data key="d4">28.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Clinical trials may evaluate targeted therapy as a treatment option for patients ineligible for immunotherapy or other standard treatments.&lt;SEP&gt;Targeted therapies are tested in clinical trials to determine their effectiveness against specific cancer types and their associated side effects.&lt;SEP&gt;option-for</data>
