      <data key="d5">Clinical trials may involve immunotherapy as a treatment option for patients with metastatic or regional squamous cell skin cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Immunotherapy is evaluated in clinical trials to assess its ability to enhance immune responses against cancer and its long-term safety profile.&lt;SEP&gt;option-for</data>
