      <data key="d5">Clinical trials are a key method for evaluating new treatment approaches for patients with primary CNS lymphoma.&lt;SEP&gt;Clinical trials are part of the research options for managing primary CNS lymphoma, contributing to new treatment methods.&lt;SEP&gt;Clinical trials are part of the treatment options for patients with primary CNS lymphoma.&lt;SEP&gt;Clinical trials are recommended for primary CNS lymphoma patients to access experimental treatments and contribute to medical research.&lt;SEP&gt;Clinical trials are research events testing new treatments for primary CNS lymphoma, including experimental therapies and combination regimens.</data>
