    <edge source="Chemotherapy" target="Side Effects">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Chemotherapy is associated with a range of side effects, including fatigue, nausea, and organ damage, due to its systemic impact on both cancer and healthy cells.</data>
