    </edge>
    <edge source="Targeted Therapy" target="Side Effects">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Targeted therapies may cause side effects related to their specific molecular targets, such as skin rashes or organ toxicity, depending on the receptor inhibited.</data>
