    <edge source="Targeted Therapy" target="Cetuximab">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Cetuximab is an EGFR inhibitor used in targeted therapy, directly targeting the epidermal growth factor receptor to inhibit cancer cell growth.</data>
