    <edge source="Pelvic Exenter" target="Surgery">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Pelvic Exenter is a specialized form of Surgical intervention for localized cervical cancer recurrence.&lt;SEP&gt;Pelvic Exenter is a specialized form of surgical intervention for localized cervical cancer recurrence.</data>
