      <data key="d4">20.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The Philadelphia chromosome is a hallmark genetic abnormal Nigel in CML, directly linked to the disease's pathogenesis.&lt;SEP&gt;The Philadelphia chromosome is a hallmark genetic abnormality in CML, directly linked to the disease's pathogenesis.</data>
      <data key="d6">genetic mutation, cancer biology</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-ef6586b896c47b361bf4f6aabb4c35d5</data>
