      <data key="d6">cancer classification, medical taxonomy</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-08475506372bb4ce9ec1bd326caf0fe9</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SCLC" target="Lung Cancer">
      <data key="d4">16.0</data>
      <data key="d5">SCLC is a subtype of lung cancer, classified under the broader category of lung cancer due to its association with similar risk factors and diagnostic methods.</data>
      <data key="d6">medical classification, cancer subtypes</data>
