    <edge source="Metastatic NSCLC" target="Non-Small Cell Lung Cancer (NSCLC)">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Metastatic NSCLC is a subcategory of NSCLC representing stage 4 cancer that has spread beyond the lungs.</data>
