    <edge source="Follicular Lymphoma" target="International Consensus Classification">
      <data key="d4">16.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The International Consensus Classification (ICC) defines follicular lymphoma (FL) as grades 1 and 2, grouping them as classic FL (cFL) and distinguishing them from other subtypes.</data>
