    <edge source="Imaging Tests" target="Ultrasound">
      <data key="d4">17.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Ultrasound is a non-invasive imaging test used to detect and monitor cancerous lesions in specific body regions.&lt;SEP&gt;Ultrasound is a subcategory of imaging tests used to visualize ovarian tumors and their characteristics.</data>
      <data key="d6">imaging category, diagnostic tool&lt;SEP&gt;non-invasive diagnostics, real-time imaging</data>
