      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Bone marrow aspirate is a diagnostic procedure used to analyze cells in Acute Myeloid Leukemia (AML) for abnormalities.&lt;SEP&gt;Bone marrow aspirate is a diagnostic procedure used to analyze cells in the context of Acute Myeloid Leukemia (AML) to detect abnormalities.</data>
