      <data key="d5">Genetic changes in DNA, such as mutations or chromosomal abnormalities, are central to Acute Myeloid Leukemia (AML) development and classification.&lt;SEP&gt;Genetic changes in DNA, such as mutations or chromosomal abnormalities, are central to the development and classification of Acute Myeloid Leukemia (AML).</data>
