    </edge>
    <edge source="Multidisciplinary Care Team" target="Medical Oncologist">
      <data key="d4">108.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The Medical Oncologist is a key member of the Multidisciplinary Care Team, managing systemic therapies like chemotherapy and immunotherapy for cancer patients.&lt;SEP&gt;The Multidisciplinary Care Team includes the Medical Oncologist, who utilizes Biomarker Tests to monitor cancer progression and tailor systemic therapies.</data>
      <data key="d6">cancer treatment, team collaboration&lt;SEP&gt;treatment monitoring, personalized medicine</data>
