    <edge source="Biomarker Tests" target="Medical Oncologist">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The Medical Oncologist utilizes Biomarker Tests to monitor cancer progression and tailor systemic therapies for bladder cancer patients.</data>
