    <edge source="Ovarian Cancer" target="Pathologist">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Pathologists analyze tissue samples to determine the type and grade of ovarian cancer, playing a critical role in diagnosis and treatment planning.</data>
