    <edge source="Laboratory" target="Pathologist">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The pathologist analyzes tissue samples in the laboratory to confirm CNS lymphoma diagnoses, identifying tumor type and grading.&lt;SEP&gt;The pathologist analyzes tissue samples in the laboratory to confirm cancer diagnoses, including identifying the type and grade of CNS lymphoma.</data>
