    <edge source="Multidisciplinary Care Team" target="Pathologist">
      <data key="d4">110.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The Multidisciplinary Care Team includes the Pathologist, who analyzes biopsy samples and urine cytology results obtained during Cystoscopy to confirm cancer diagnoses and guide treatment decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Pathologist is a vital member of the Multidisciplinary Care Team, analyzing biopsy samples and urine cytology to confirm cancer diagnoses and guide treatment decisions.</data>
