      <data key="d4">17.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Fallopian Tubes are components of the Female Reproductive System.&lt;SEP&gt;The fallopian tubes are integral to the female reproductive system, facilitating egg transport from the ovaries to the uterus.</data>
