    <edge source="Computed Tomography (CT) Scan" target="Staging">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">CT scans provide detailed images to determine cancer extent, essential for accurate staging.&lt;SEP&gt;CT scans provide detailed images to determine the extent of cancer, which is essential for accurate staging.</data>
