    <edge source="B-ALL" target="ALL">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">B-ALL is a subtype of ALL originating in B-cell lymphocytes, contributing to distinct clinical and therapeutic characteristics.&lt;SEP&gt;B-ALL is a subtype of ALL, originating in B-cell lymphocytes and representing the most common form of the disease.</data>
      <data key="d6">cancer subtypes, classification&lt;SEP&gt;subtype classification, disease differentiation</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-c5bc83f5f4f3e29b7f0a6f4787c3ad83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7606b44d6a30ad0519bc4c10785de79a</data>
