    <edge source="T-ALL" target="ALL">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">T-ALL is a subtype of ALL originating in T-cell lymphocytes, differing from B-ALL in pathogenesis and treatment response.&lt;SEP&gt;T-ALL is a subtype of ALL, originating in T-cell lymphocytes and representing a less common form of the disease.</data>
      <data key="d6">cancer subtypes, classification&lt;SEP&gt;subtype classification, disease differentiation</data>
