      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">4Kscore, PHI, and IsoPSA are specific blood tests within Blood and Urine Tests used for prostate cancer risk assessment.</data>
      <data key="d6">test categorization, biomarker specificity</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-9dc281a303d0d4c5300c0c1c45b739ed</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ExoDx, miR Sentinel, MPS, PCA3, SelectMDy" target="Blood and Urine Tests">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">ExoDx, miR Sentinel, MPS, PCA3, and SelectMDx are urine-based tests within Blood and Urine Tests for prostate cancer evaluation.</data>
