      <data key="d5">Hormone Therapy, including Menopausal Hormone Therapy (MHT) and Hormone Replacement Therapy (HRT), is used to manage symptoms of Menopause caused by cancer treatments.&lt;SEP&gt;Hormone Therapy, including Menopausal Hormone Therapy (MHT) and Hormone Replacement Therapy (HRT), manages Menopause symptoms caused by cancer treatments.</data>
