      <data key="d4">27.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Invasive breast cancer can progress to metastatic breast cancer (MBC) when cancer cells spread beyond the breast and lymph nodes to distant organs.&lt;SEP&gt;Metastatic breast cancer (MBC) is a form of invasive breast cancer that has spread beyond the breast and lymph nodes.</data>
