    <edge source="Breast cancer" target="Prognostic stage">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Prognostic stage is a critical factor in determining the outlook and treatment plan for breast cancer patients, integrating TNM data with biomarkers and grading.&lt;SEP&gt;Prognostic stage is critical for determining treatment strategies and survival outcomes for breast cancer patients, incorporating TNM data and biomarkers.</data>
