    <edge source="mTOR inhibitors" target="Endocrine therapy">
      <data key="d4">16.0</data>
      <data key="d5">mTOR inhibitors are used to restore the effectiveness of endocrine therapy in cases where it becomes less effective, targeting the mTOR protein pathway.&lt;SEP&gt;mTOR inhibitors are used to restore the effectiveness of endocrine therapy when it becomes resistant due to mTOR overactivity."|&gt;"treatment restoration, resistance management</data>
