    <edge source="HER2-negative breast cancer" target="PARP inhibitors">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">PARP inhibitors are indicated for HER2-negative breast cancer patients with BRCA1/BRCA2 mutations, as these tumors lack alternative DNA repair pathways."|&gt;"tumor biology, genetic targeting</data>
