    </edge>
    <edge source="Depression" target="Primary CNS Lymphoma">
      <data key="d4">14.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Depression is a significant psychological issue in primary CNS lymphoma patients, often linked to distress and treatment-related factors.</data>
