    <edge source="Steroids" target="Primary CNS Lymphoma">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Steroids are used to shrink lymphomas and reduce brain swelling in patients with primary CNS lymphoma, though their use is limited due to side effects.</data>
