    <edge source="Chemotherapy" target="Primary CNS Lymphoma">
      <data key="d4">17.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Chemotherapy is a primary treatment modality for Primary CNS Lymphoma, targeting cancer cells systemically.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy is a standard treatment for primary CNS lymphoma, often administered intravenously or orally to target cancer cells.</data>
