    <edge source="Radiation Therapy" target="Primary CNS Lymphoma">
      <data key="d4">26.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Radiation Therapy is a primary treatment method for Primary CNS Lymphoma, particularly for tumors in the eyes or brain, with potential side effects like vision impairment and nervous system damage.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiation Therapy is a primary treatment method for Primary CNS Lymphoma, particularly for tumors in the eyes or brain, with potential side effects like vision impairment.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiation Therapy is another key treatment approach for Primary CNS Lymphoma, targeting localized tumors in the central nervous system.</data>
