    <edge source="Targeted Therapy" target="Primary CNS Lymphoma">
      <data key="d4">16.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Targeted Therapy is used to treat Primary CNS Lymphoma by attacking specific cancer cell mechanisms while sparing healthy tissue, offering a more precise treatment approach.&lt;SEP&gt;Targeted Therapy is used to treat Primary CNS Lymphoma by attacking specific cancer cell mechanisms while sparing healthy tissue.</data>
