    <edge source="Chemotherapy" target="Stem Cell Rescue">
      <data key="d4">26.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Chemotherapy is a key component of stem cell rescue, as it prepares the body for stem cell reinfusion by eliminating cancer cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Stem cell rescue is used after high-dose chemotherapy to restore blood cell production in primary CNS lymphoma patients.</data>
      <data key="d6">recovery support, treatment follow-up&lt;SEP&gt;therapeutic synergy, cellular regeneration</data>
