    </edge>
    <edge source="Colectomy" target="Colon Cancer">
      <data key="d4">38.0</data>
      <data key="d5">A colectomy is a surgical procedure performed to remove part or all of the colon, often as a primary treatment for colon cancer to eliminate the tumor.&lt;SEP&gt;Colectomy is a primary treatment for colon cancer, involving the surgical removal of the affected colon segment.</data>
      <data key="d6">medical treatment, surgical intervention&lt;SEP&gt;surgical intervention, cancer treatment</data>
