    <edge source="Chemotherapy" target="Stage 2">
      <data key="d4">32.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Chemotherapy is a recommended treatment for ovarian cancer, particularly for Stage 2 tumors, following surgical resection.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy is recommended after colectomy for high-risk stage 2 colon cancers to reduce the likelihood of recurrence.</data>
      <data key="d6">treatment protocol, cancer management&lt;SEP&gt;treatment protocols, cancer recurrence</data>
