    <edge source="Chemotherapy" target="Stage 3">
      <data key="d4">34.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Chemotherapy is a recommended treatment for ovarian cancer, particularly for Stage 3 tumors, following surgical resection.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy is recommended after colectomy for all stage 3 colon cancers to target residual cancer cells and prevent further spread.</data>
