    </edge>
    <edge source="Platinum Chemotherapy" target="Cervical Cancer">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Platinum chemotherapy is a cornerstone of chemoradiation regimens, enhancing radiation efficacy and reducing cancer recurrence.</data>
