    <edge source="Bladder Cancer" target="Cystoscopy">
      <data key="d4">35.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Cystoscopy is a diagnostic procedure used to visually examine the bladder and urinary tract for signs of bladder cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Cystoscopy is a procedure to examine the bladder for cancerous growths.&lt;SEP&gt;Cystoscopy is a procedure to visually inspect the bladder for cancer signs, often used to confirm or rule out bladder cancer and guide treatment decisions.</data>
