      <data key="d5">Biomarker Tests and Cystoscopy are complementary diagnostic tools used to detect and monitor bladder cancer, with Cystoscopy providing direct visualization and Biomarker Tests offering molecular insights.&lt;SEP&gt;Cystoscopy and Biomarker Tests are complementary diagnostic tools used to detect and monitor bladder cancer, with Cystoscopy providing direct visualization and Biomarker Tests offering molecular insights.</data>
