      <data key="d5">Cystoscopy and Urine Cytology are both used to detect bladder cancer, with Cystoscopy offering direct visualization and Urine Cytology analyzing urine samples for cancer cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Urine Cytology and Cystoscopy are both used to detect bladder cancer, with Cystoscopy providing direct visualization and Urine Cytology analyzing urine samples for cancer cells.</data>
