    </edge>
    <edge source="Lobectomy" target="Total Thyroidectomy">
      <data key="d4">16.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Lobectomy is an alternative to Total Thyroidectomy for small, low-risk thyroid cancers, where thyroid hormone replacement may not be necessary or may be at a lower dose.</data>
