    <edge source="Astrocytoma" target="Glioma">
      <data key="d4">36.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Astrocytoma is a specific subtype of glioma that originates from astrocytes, a type of glial cell in the central nervous system.&lt;SEP&gt;Astrocytoma is a subtype of glioma, originating from astrocytes.</data>
      <data key="d6">subclassification, tumor type&lt;SEP&gt;subclassification, tumor types</data>
