    <edge source="Oligodendroglioma" target="Glioma">
      <data key="d4">36.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Oligodendrog,lioma is another subtype of glioma that arises from oligodendrocytes, contributing to the diversity of glioma classifications.&lt;SEP&gt;Oligodendroglioma is a subtype of glioma, originating from oligodendrocytes.&lt;SEP&gt;Oligodendroglioma is another subtype of glioma that arises from oligodendrocytes, contributing to the diversity of glioma classifications.</data>
