    </edge>
    <edge source="Glioblastoma" target="Glioma">
      <data key="d4">36.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Glioblastoma is a subtype of glioma, known for its aggressive nature and destructive potential.&lt;SEP&gt;Glioblastoma is the most aggressive subtype of glioma, characterized by rapid growth and poor prognosis despite intensive treatment.</data>
      <data key="d6">subclassification, malignant tumor&lt;SEP&gt;subclassification, tumor types</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-da0bfe00946dcdff3a8a6fb3d73ce6e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa5247d6b8c17e58ab315a0d641c7ad3</data>
    </edge>
