    <edge source="Richter transformation" target="CLL">
      <data key="d4">26.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Richter transformation is a condition related to CLL, representing a more aggressive progression that requires intensified treatment strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;Richter transformation is a rare complication of CLL that can progress to more aggressive lymphomas like DLBCL or Hodgkin lymphoma.</data>
