    <edge source="Watch and Wait" target="CLL">
      <data key="d4">34.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The 'watch and wait' approach is a treatment strategy for CLL where monitoring is prioritized over immediate intervention unless specific criteria are met.&lt;SEP&gt;Watch and Wait is an event where patients with CLL are monitored without immediate treatment, allowing for observation of disease progression and response to natural course.</data>
      <data key="d6">treatment approach, disease monitoring&lt;SEP&gt;treatment strategy, disease monitoring</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-098a64d7118fc8e1eb3e91ba0124258c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67015f3916810c4378b2ed269cc27f29</data>
    </edge>
