      <data key="d5">Test results are vital for diagnosing bladder cancer, determining its stage, and tailoring effective treatment strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;Test results guide the treatment and management of bladder cancer, informing decisions on therapy and monitoring for recurrence.</data>
