    <edge source="MRI" target="Imaging Tests">
      <data key="d4">35.0</data>
      <data key="d5">MRI is a non-invasive Imaging Test that provides detailed images of soft tissues, including head and neck tumors.&lt;SEP&gt;MRI is a subcategory of imaging tests providing detailed soft tissue imaging for ovarian cancer evaluation.&lt;SEP&gt;MRI is another specific imaging test used to assess internal structures and provide detailed images for cancer evaluation.</data>
