    <edge source="Biopsy" target="Imaging Tests">
      <data key="d4">32.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Biopsy is a category of tests that follows positive imaging results to confirm the presence of cancerous cells in breast tissue.&lt;SEP&gt;Imaging Tests may precede or guide Biopsy procedures to target specific areas of the prostate for tissue sampling.</data>
