    <edge source="NCCN" target="NCCN Guidelines for Patients">
      <data key="d4">112.0</data>
      <data key="d5">NCCN Guidelines for Patients are resources provided by NCCN to help patients understand cancer care and treatment options.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN develops NCCN Guidelines for Patients to assist patients in understanding cancer care and treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN develops NCCN Guidelines for Patients to assist patients in understanding cancer care.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN provides the NCCN Guidelines for Patients as a resource for cancer patients and caregivers.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN provides the NCCN Guidelines for Patients as a resource for cancer patients.&lt;SEP&gt;The NCCN Guidelines for Patients are developed by the National Comprehensive Cancer Network, reflecting its expertise in cancer treatment standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The NCCN Guidelines for Patients is a resource developed by the NCCN organization to guide cancer care.&lt;SEP&gt;The NCCN organization develops and provides the Guidelines for Patients as a cancer care resource.&lt;SEP&gt;The NCCN provides guidelines for patients and providers, which are based on the latest research and practices at leading cancer centers.&lt;SEP&gt;The NCCN provides patient-oriented guidelines to help individuals understand and manage prostate cancer, including staging and treatment options.</data>
      <data key="d6">guideline development, organizational authority&lt;SEP&gt;guideline development, patient education&lt;SEP&gt;guideline development, patient resources&lt;SEP&gt;guideline provision, medical standards&lt;SEP&gt;guideline provision, patient education&lt;SEP&gt;guideline provision, patient resources&lt;SEP&gt;medical education, patient resources&lt;SEP&gt;resource development, guideline application</data>
