    <edge source="Chemotherapy" target="NCCN">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">NCCN provides guidelines for chemotherapy regimens used in anal and perianal cancer treatment, including drug combinations and administration protocols.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN provides guidelines on chemotherapy regimens for cancer treatment, including their use in combination with radiation therapy for anal cancer.</data>
