    <edge source="Chemotherapy" target="Radiation Therapy">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Radiation therapy and chemotherapy are both categories of systemic cancer treatments, often used together as adjuvant therapies to target cancer cells and reduce recurrence risks.</data>
