    <edge source="Systemic Therapy" target="Radiation Therapy">
      <data key="d4">25.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Radiation therapy is a distinct treatment category that complements systemic therapies like chemotherapy and targeted therapy in comprehensive cancer care.&lt;SEP&gt;Systemic therapy and radiation therapy are often combined to treat advanced-stage squamous cell skin cancer, especially when surgery is not an option.</data>
      <data key="d6">complementary treatment, combined therapy&lt;SEP&gt;complementary treatments, multidisciplinary care</data>
