    <edge source="Chemoradiation" target="Radiation Therapy">
      <data key="d4">36.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Chemoradiation combines chemotherapy with radiation therapy to improve treatment outcomes for bladder cancer patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiation Therapy is a core component of Chemoradiation, combining it with chemotherapy for advanced cervical cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiation Therapy is a core component of Chemoradiation, which combines it with chemotherapy for advanced cervical cancer.</data>
