    <edge source="Chemoradiation" target="Chemotherapy">
      <data key="d4">45.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Chemoradiation combines chemotherapy with radiation therapy to enhance treatment efficacy for bladder cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemoradiation combines chemotherapy with radiation therapy to treat cancers like anal cancer, enhancing treatment effectiveness through synergistic effects.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemoradiation combines chemotherapy with radiation therapy to treat cancers like anal cancer, enhancing treatment effectiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy is paired with Radiation Therapy in Chemoradiation to enhance cancer cell destruction in locally advanced cervical cancer.</data>
      <data key="d6">combined treatment, medical strategy&lt;SEP&gt;combined treatment, synergistic effects&lt;SEP&gt;treatment combination, therapeutic synergy</data>
