    <edge source="Immunotherapy" target="Systemic Therapy">
      <data key="d4">52.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Immunotherapy is a systemic therapy that enhances the body's immune response to fight cancer, often used for advanced or recurrent cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;Immunotherapy is a type of systemic therapy that boosts the immune system against cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Immunotherapy is a type of systemic therapy that enhances the immune system to fight cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Systemic Therapy includes Immunotherapy, which enhances the immune system to fight cancer."|&gt;"includes</data>
