      <data key="d5">Systemic Therapy includes Targeted Therapy, which focuses on specific molecules involved in cancer growth."|&gt;"includes&lt;SEP&gt;Targeted therapy is a specialized form of systemic therapy that attacks specific molecular targets in cancer cells, improving treatment precision.&lt;SEP&gt;Targeted therapy is a type of systemic therapy that attacks specific cancer cells.</data>
